  "decisions": {
    "retained": "Bed-flat 1.6 mm sheets, rectangular socket/tongue joints and low breakaway runners on a connected carrier.",
    "socketMapping": "4.4 mm tongues; socket (4.4+allowance) \u00d7 (sheet+allowance), matching source 4.5\u00d71.7 at sheet 1.6 and allowance .1 mm. Default .15 proposed for glue clearance.",
    "newDesign": "Seven-panel gravity tower: tray, twin pierced cheeks, rear wall, exit arch and two alternating inclined baffles. Eight floor tongue joints plus four sloped baffle slots.",
    "proposed": "2.4 mm carrier rails, .4\u2013.6 mm runners, 82\u201394 mm tower, 28\u201336 degree baffles; 14 mm nominal end gap, 12 mm minimum vertical separation, 6 mm external feed objects. Inclined joint cutters follow actual baffle pose. All new dimensions, glue retention and flow are proposals, not measured source behavior.",
    "assembly": "Fit inclined baffle tongues into one cheek, slide opposite cheek along X; lower bonded tower into floor; then lower rear wall/front arch. Eight floor shoulders, four baffle seats, mandatory adhesive.",
    "feedBounds": "External 6 mm object only; 14 mm nominal baffle end opening, at least 12 mm conservative vertical ramp separation; 30 mm arch height, minimum 13 mm central exit width. Not a flow simulation or fair die-roll claim."
